@startuml Smart Campus - Domain Class Diagram (Revised)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

' ========================= Entity classes =========================
class Student {
  - studentId : String
  - name : String
  --
  + bookRoom(room : Room, start : DateTime, end : DateTime) : void
  + cancelBooking(booking : Booking) : void
}

class Room {
  - roomId : String
  - isBlocked : boolean
  --
  + block() : void
  + unblock() : void
  + checkAvailability(start : DateTime, end : DateTime) : boolean
}

class Booking {
  - bookingId : String
  - startTime : DateTime
  - endTime : DateTime
  - status : String
  - confirmationCode : String
  --
  + cancel() : void
  + isValidDuration() : boolean
}

' ========================= Associations =========================
' Reading: One student makes 0..* bookings; each booking belongs to exactly 1 student.
Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >

' Reading: One room contains 0..* bookings; each booking is associated with exactly 1 room.
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : contains >

' ========================= Constraints & Notes =========================
note right of Booking
  <b>{R1}</b> startTime in future, 0 < duration <= 2 hours.
  <b>{R4}</b> confirmationCode generated upon success.
  <b>{R2} Active bookings for the same room cannot overlap.</b>
  <i>Assumption:</i> Touching bookings (e.g., 12:00 end, 12:00 start)
  do NOT overlap under R2.
end note

note left of Room
  <b>{R3}</b> A blocked room cannot accept a new booking.
  <i>Assumption:</i> When an Administrator blocks a room,
  all existing active future bookings for this room
  are automatically cancelled.
end note

@enduml
